Looking for internships in AI, Data Science, or Research & Development? 

The Statistics Graduate Student Association is excited to invite you to a virtual career panel with scientists from Procter & Gamble on Tuesday, October 13, at 3:00 PM Central on Microsoft Teams.

P&G is one of the largest consumer goods companies in the world, home to household brands like Tide, Pampers, Gillette, Crest, and Olay. It is consistently ranked among the world's top employers, with a 4.1/5 Glassdoor rating and about 81% of employees recommending it to a friend, plus benefits that include comprehensive health coverage, a 401(k), stock purchase plans, generous PTO and parental leave, flexible schedules, tuition assistance, and dedicated career development. Behind its products is a large community of statisticians and data scientists who design consumer studies, model product performance, and turn data into decisions that reach millions of people every day. This panel is a rare chance to hear directly from the people doing that work.


